<title>USA: A.P. Green says to buy lime plant.</title>
<headline>A.P. Green says to buy lime plant.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO, Mo. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.P. Green Industries Inc said it reached an agreement in principle to buy the lime plant of Eastern Ridge Lime LP, an affiliate of  Mississippi Lime Co, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Closing on the purchase of the Ripplemead, Va., plant is expected before year-end, said Green, a mining and mineral processing concern.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
